{"id":"4fb22144b0e10ac9","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-internal-choice-local-sections.md","title":"Theorem — 内部选择公理给出满态射的局部截面","display":"Theorem — 内部选择公理给出满态射的局部截面","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-internal-choice-local-sections","aliases":["14-thm-internal-choice-local-sections"],"display":"Theorem — 内部选择公理给出满态射的局部截面","source_ref":"VI exercises, Exercise16(a), printed p.346, DjVu179 left","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-df-choice-axioms]]","[[14-df-cartesian-closed-category]]","[[14-df-pullbacks-equalizers]]","[[14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity]]","[[14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-internal-choice-local-sections"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-internal-choice-local-sections</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — 内部选择公理给出满态射的局部截面"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"VI exercises, Exercise16(a), printed p.346, DjVu179 left"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cba7e4db2a363792\" href=\"?note=cba7e4db2a363792\" title=\"14-df-choice-axioms\">14-df-choice-axioms</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4bf0b109a78ca196\" href=\"?note=4bf0b109a78ca196\" title=\"14-df-cartesian-closed-category\">14-df-cartesian-closed-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"199dc3cf97e92fa1\" href=\"?note=199dc3cf97e92fa1\" title=\"14-df-pullbacks-equalizers\">14-df-pullbacks-equalizers</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4cd3b0d29b80beda\" href=\"?note=4cd3b0d29b80beda\" title=\"14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity\">14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8e7f6de1ab6fc49f\" href=\"?note=8e7f6de1ab6fc49f\" title=\"14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism\">14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为初等拓扑斯，满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"cba7e4db2a363792\" href=\"?note=cba7e4db2a363792\" title=\"14-df-choice-axioms\">14-df-choice-axioms</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IAC}(\\mathcal E)\">\\(\\operatorname{IAC}(\\mathcal E)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:X\\to Y\">\\(p:X\\to Y\\)</span> 为满态射，有限积和指数均已选定。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_Y,\\pi_U\">\\(\\pi_Y,\\pi_U\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\\times U\">\\(Y\\times U\\)</span> 的投影。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists U\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\exists e:U\\to1\\ \\exists s:Y\\times U\\to X\\quad \\operatorname{IsEpi}(e)\\land p\\circ s=\\pi_Y.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists U\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\exists e:U\\to1\\ \\exists s:Y\\times U\\to X\\quad \\operatorname{IsEpi}(e)\\land p\\circ s=\\pi_Y.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall U,e,s\\quad\\bigl(e:U\\to1\\land s:Y\\times U\\to X\\land p\\circ s=\\pi_Y\\Rightarrow(p\\times1_U)\\circ\\langle s,\\pi_U\\rangle=1_{Y\\times U}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall U,e,s\\quad\\bigl(e:U\\to1\\land s:Y\\times U\\to X\\land p\\circ s=\\pi_Y\\Rightarrow(p\\times1_U)\\circ\\langle s,\\pi_U\\rangle=1_{Y\\times U}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>按原书 VI 练习16(a)，印刷 p.346，DjVu179 左页。IAC 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p^Y:X^Y\\to Y^Y\">\\(p^Y:X^Y\\to Y^Y\\)</span> 满。将它沿恒等 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1_Y\">\\(1_Y\\)</span> 的指数转置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner1_Y\\urcorner:1\\to Y^Y\">\\(\\ulcorner1_Y\\urcorner:1\\to Y^Y\\)</span> 拉回，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e:U\\twoheadrightarrow1\">\\(e:U\\twoheadrightarrow1\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v:U\\to X^Y\">\\(v:U\\to X^Y\\)</span>。满态射拉回稳定保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 满。将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 反转置得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s:Y\\times U\\to X\">\\(s:Y\\times U\\to X\\)</span>，拉回方程恰好给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ps=\\pi_Y\">\\(ps=\\pi_Y\\)</span>；配对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle s,\\pi_U\\rangle\">\\(\\langle s,\\pi_U\\rangle\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\times1_U\">\\(p\\times1_U\\)</span> 的截面。未从局部满性选择全局截面，因此没有把 IAC 偷换成 AC。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-choice-axioms","status":"resolved","id":"cba7e4db2a363792","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-choice-axioms]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-cartesian-closed-category","status":"resolved","id":"4bf0b109a78ca196","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-cartesian-closed-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-pullbacks-equalizers","status":"resolved","id":"199dc3cf97e92fa1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-pullbacks-equalizers]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity","status":"resolved","id":"4cd3b0d29b80beda","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism","status":"resolved","id":"8e7f6de1ab6fc49f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-monomorphism-epimorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-choice-axioms","status":"resolved","id":"cba7e4db2a363792","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯，满足 [[14-df-choice-axioms]] 的 $\\operatorname{IAC}(\\mathcal E)$。$p:X\\to Y$ 为满态射，有限积和指数均已选定。$\\pi_Y,\\pi_U$ 是 $Y\\times U$ 的投影。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IAC}(\\mathcal E)","display":false},{"tex":"p:X\\to Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_Y,\\pi_U","display":false},{"tex":"Y\\times U","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists U\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\ \\exists e:U\\to1\\ \\exists s:Y\\times U\\to X\\quad \\operatorname{IsEpi}(e)\\land p\\circ s=\\pi_Y.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall U,e,s\\quad\\bigl(e:U\\to1\\land s:Y\\times U\\to X\\land p\\circ s=\\pi_Y\\Rightarrow(p\\times1_U)\\circ\\langle s,\\pi_U\\rangle=1_{Y\\times U}\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"p^Y:X^Y\\to Y^Y","display":false},{"tex":"1_Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner1_Y\\urcorner:1\\to Y^Y","display":false},{"tex":"e:U\\twoheadrightarrow1","display":false},{"tex":"v:U\\to X^Y","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"s:Y\\times U\\to X","display":false},{"tex":"ps=\\pi_Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle s,\\pi_U\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"p\\times1_U","display":false}],"bytes":1809,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-158","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-internal-choice-local-sections|thm-246 — 内部选择公理给出满态射的局部截面]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-108","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-internal-choice-local-sections]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-265","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-internal-choice-local-sections]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-187","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-internal-choice-local-sections]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-159","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-internal-choice-local-sections|thm-246 — 内部选择公理给出满态射的局部截面]]"},{"id":"1d4177d202e67eb5","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定任意 $m:A\\hookrightarrow X$，取[[14-thm-double-copy-gluing-complement]]的胶合满态射 $q:X+X\\twoheadrightarrow Q$。[[14-thm-internal-choice-local-sections]]给覆盖 $e:U\\twoheadrightarrow1$，使 $q\\times1_U$ 有截面。乘以 $U$ 是指数函子的左伴随，因而保持该余等化子及余积；故[[14-thm-double-copy-gluing-complement]]应用于 $m\\times1_U:A\\times U\\hookrightarrow X\\times U$，得到这个拉回子对象可补，即满足排中律。"}],"outgoing":["cba7e4db2a363792","4bf0b109a78ca196","199dc3cf97e92fa1","4cd3b0d29b80beda","8e7f6de1ab6fc49f"]}